#. あのさ…苗木君が嫌じゃなければだけど…
msgctxt "0001 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Um, if you don't hate the idea..."
msgstr ""

#. …また、一緒にお話しない？
msgctxt "0002 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "...would you like to talk some more?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女にこんな風に頼まれて、
#. 断れる人間がいるなら会ってみたい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez, if there's anyone who can say no to someone who\n"
"asks like that, I'd like to meet 'em.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だったらさ…
#. もう少し不二咲さんの事を教えてよ。
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sure, I'd love to learn more about you."
msgstr ""

#. いいけど…何を…？
msgctxt "0005 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Okay. But...what do you want to know?"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲さんは、今はどんなプログラムを作ってるの？
#. それも、すごい物なんでしょ？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, let's see... What kind of program are you\n"
"working on now? I bet it's pretty amazing."
msgstr ""

#. うーんとねぇ…今はまだ研究段階なんだけど…
msgctxt "0007 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Oh! Actually, I just started the research process for\n"
"something..."
msgstr ""

#. 前に話した自動応答システムも流用した、
#. ちょっと<CLT 3>複雑なプログラム<CLT>なんだ。
msgctxt "0008 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"You remember that database software I told you about?\n"
"I'm retooling it into something <CLT 3>a little more complex.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、詳しくは話せないんだよ…
#. 研究費を出してもらってる企業さんとの契約もあって…
msgctxt "0009 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"But I signed an NDA with the company that hired me, so\n"
"I can't really go into the details..."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…盗まれたりしたら大変だもんね…
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, they probably wouldn't want the wrong people to\n"
"hear about it, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 別に、苗木君を信じてない訳じゃないんだけど…
#. でも、約束だから…
msgctxt "0011 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"It's not that I don't trust you or anything! I\n"
"just...made a promise, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめんね…
msgctxt "0012 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "S-Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. ううん、いいんだよ。
#. 話せないような事を聞いたボクの方が悪いんだし…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"No, it's okay. It's my fault for asking about\n"
"something you couldn't talk about."
msgstr ""

#. あ、でも…
msgctxt "0014 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Oh, but..."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっとだけヒントを言うくらいなら、
#. 多分、大丈夫だから…
msgctxt "0015 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "...maybe I can give you a little hint."
msgstr ""

#. アルファベットで<CLT 3>“ＡＩ”<CLT>かな…
msgctxt "0016 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "It has to do with <CLT 3>simulating human thoughts<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 人工知能
msgctxt "0017 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Artificial intelligence"
msgstr ""

#. バーチャルリアリティ
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Virtual reality"
msgstr ""

#. バーチャルリアリティ、だったっけ？
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you talking about virtual reality?"
msgstr ""

#. それは違うんだぁ…
msgctxt "0020 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Nope, not quite!"
msgstr ""

#. バーチャルリアリティっていうのは
#. 仮想現実って訳されて…
msgctxt "0021 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Virtual reality is less about our thoughts and more\n"
"about our senses."
msgstr ""

#. 実際には形がないけれど、まるでそこにあるみたいに
#. 人間に錯覚させる事を言うんだよ。
msgctxt "0022 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"It doesn't have a physical form, of course, but the\n"
"illusion is real enough to convince most people."
msgstr ""

#. アルファベットで言うと、“ＶＲ”だね。
msgctxt "0023 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"We just call virtual reality \"VR\" for short. What I'm\n"
"talking about has a short nickname like that, too!"
msgstr ""

#. ロボット工学
msgctxt "0024 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Robotics"
msgstr ""

#. ロボット工学だよね？
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you doing robotics research?"
msgstr ""

#. うーん、違うんだよね…
#. 確かに…関わり合いの深い分野ではあるけど…
msgctxt "0026 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Hmm... Not exactly. Although the two fields are\n"
"definitely connected."
msgstr ""

#. え、えっと…
#. これ以上はヒントが出せないんだけど…
msgctxt "0027 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Sorry, I can't give you any more hints."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君だったら…わかるんじゃないかな…？
msgctxt "0028 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "But you're smart. I know you can figure it out!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ヒントはＡＩ…
#. そのまま解釈すればいいんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She said it has to do with simulating human thoughts,\n"
"right? Which must mean...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 人工知能…だよね？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're developing some kind of artificial\n"
"intelligence, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. あ！　バレちゃった！？
msgctxt "0031 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Ah! You figured it out!"
msgstr ""

#. ヒント…言い過ぎちゃったかな…
msgctxt "0032 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Was my hint too easy...?"
msgstr ""

#. どうしよう…
#. 約束破ったのがバレたら、怒られちゃうよぉ…
msgctxt "0033 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Ahh, what am I gonna do? If they find out I broke my\n"
"promise, they might..."
msgstr ""

#. だ、大丈夫だよ…
#. 絶対に誰にも言わないから…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Don't worry. I'm not gonna say anything to anyone."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…そうだよね…
#. 苗木君だし、大丈夫だよね…
msgctxt "0035 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, I know... I know I can trust you."
msgstr ""

#. …だったら、もう言っちゃおうかな。
msgctxt "0036 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Okay, I guess I can tell you about it."
msgstr ""

#. あのね、今開発してるのは、
#. 今までなかったような人工知能で…
msgctxt "0037 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"I'm working on a type of artificial intelligence the\n"
"world has never seen before."
msgstr ""

#. ちゃんと人間と同じ思考回路で、
#. 人間の仕事をこなせるような<CLT 3>“強いＡＩ”<CLT>なんだ…
msgctxt "0038 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"It's what we call a <CLT 3>strong AI<CLT>. It's designed to\n"
"think like a human, to process any mental task we can."
msgstr ""

#. 強いＡＩ…？
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A strong AI...?"
msgstr ""

#. 人工知能研究の分野では、
#. “強いＡＩと弱いＡＩ”って問題があってね…
msgctxt "0040 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"You see, in the field of artificial intelligence,\n"
"there's strong AI and weak AI."
msgstr ""

#. 弱いＡＩは、人間的な認知能力を必要としない程度の
#. 問題解決を行うソフトウェアの事だよ。
msgctxt "0041 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Weak AI isn't meant to match human intelligence. It's\n"
"simply a type of problem-solving software."
msgstr ""

#. 機械自体が本当に思考している訳じゃなくて、
#. プログラムに従って処理しているだけって事…
msgctxt "0042 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"A weak AI isn't actually thinking, it's just executing\n"
"actions programmed into it."
msgstr ""

#. 一方の強いＡＩって言うのは、
#. <CLT 3>真の自意識や自我を持つコンピューター<CLT>の事だよ。
msgctxt "0043 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Strong AI, on the other hand, is a program that can\n"
"achieve true <CLT 3>self-consciousness<CLT>—full ego awareness."
msgstr ""

#. 強いＡＩの観点からすると、
#. 正しいプログラムは精神を持つって事になるんだけど…
msgctxt "0044 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"In other words, a strong AI is a complete entity, a\n"
"computer program capable of becoming aware."
msgstr ""

#. でも、その考えに否定的な学者も、
#. 少なくないんだよ…
msgctxt "0045 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"But it's always just been a hypothesis. Plenty of\n"
"experts don't think it's even possible."
msgstr ""

#. まるでＳＦみたいだけど…
#. それを不二咲さんが作ってるの？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It sounds like something from a sci-fi movie... And\n"
"you're working on something like that?"
msgstr ""

#. 今は、まだまだ研究段階だけどね…
msgctxt "0047 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Well like I said, right now I'm just researching it."
msgstr ""

#. 人間並の知識や知性を持つプログラミングに関しては、
#. かなり進んでると思うけど…
msgctxt "0048 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"I've made lots of progress on the programming side,\n"
"and the intelligence development..."
msgstr ""

#. 自我や自意識となると、まだまだ先…
#. もしかしたら、ずっと完成しないかもしれない…
msgctxt "0049 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"...but when it comes to actual awareness, it's still a\n"
"long way off. It might even be impossible..."
msgstr ""

#. そうなの…？
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. なんて言うか…
#. ちょっと変な話になっちゃうんだけどさ…
msgctxt "0051 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "I'm not sure how to put it, but..."
msgstr ""

#. どんなにプログラムを優秀にして、複雑にしても…
msgctxt "0052 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "No matter how well designed or complex a program is..."
msgstr ""

#. 人間の脳モデルのシミュレーションが可能なほどの
#. ハードウェアやソフトウェアがあったとしても…
msgctxt "0053 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"No matter how closely the software can simulate the\n"
"workings of the human brain..."
msgstr ""

#. …それだけじゃ足りないと思うんだよ。
msgctxt "0054 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "...I don't think that's enough."
msgstr ""

#. いくら人間の思考に近いプログラムが出来たとしても、
#. それだけじゃ決定的に<CLT 3>足りない物<CLT>があると思うんだ。
msgctxt "0055 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"If the program is only *simulating* thought, it will\n"
"always be <CLT 3>lacking something<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 足りない物…？
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Lacking...?"
msgstr ""

#. なんて言うか…
msgctxt "0057 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>魂<CLT>みたいな何か…かな…
msgctxt "0058 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "I guess you could say...a <CLT 3>soul<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. もし、自分の魂をプログラムに込める事が出来たら、
#. その人工知能は“強いＡＩ”になるかもしれないけど…
msgctxt "0059 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"If you could somehow pour your own soul into the\n"
"software, maybe then a strong AI could be created."
msgstr ""

#. でも、魂って…
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait...a soul?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、よくわかんないし…
#. それに、プログラマーが言う言葉じゃないよね…
msgctxt "0061 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I know. It's not a programming term. I'm not\n"
"even sure how that would work on a technical level."
msgstr ""

#. …ごめんね。今の言葉は忘れて。
msgctxt "0062 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "S-Sorry, forget I mentioned it..."
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、今はまだ研究段階で、
#. どっちにしろ、この程度の事しか話せないんだ…
msgctxt "0063 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, all I have right now is the theory. There's\n"
"still lots of research left to do."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>人工知能か…ちょっと難しかったけど、
#. なんか興味深い話だったな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Artificial intelligence sounds like a pretty tough\n"
"subject. But I'm glad I got to hear about it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. また…長々とつまらない話をしちゃったね…
#. 退屈だったでしょ…？
msgctxt "0065 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"I wasted your time on another boring topic. I must\n"
"have bored you to death, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ううん。退屈どころか、すごく面白かったよ。
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No, the complete opposite! It was really interesting!"
msgstr ""

#. …え？　ホントに？
msgctxt "0067 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "You mean it...?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあさ！　今度、お話する時は、
#. 苗木君の話を聞かせてよ！
msgctxt "0068 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Okay! Next time we talk, I wanna hear about you!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、ボクの話なんて…
#. 不二咲さんと違って、本当に退屈なだけだから…
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, well... Unlike you, I really *am* boring."
msgstr ""

#. …ダメなの！　今度は苗木君の番なの！
msgctxt "0070 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "No excuses! It's your turn next time!"
msgstr ""

#. わ、わかったよ…
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr ""

#. …えへへ、やった。
msgctxt "0072 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Ehehe. Yay!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女にこんな風に頼まれて、
#. 断れる人間がいるとしたら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When she says it like that, I think the only way to\n"
"refuse...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それこそ、魂のない人工知能だけなのかもしれないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...is if you're one of those soulless AI programs she\n"
"mentioned.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>不二咲千尋の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Chihiro's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>不二咲さんと別れた後、
#. ボクはいったん、自分の部屋に帰る事にした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once we were all done, I headed back to my room for a\n"
"little while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
